<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <title>{{title}}</title>
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@100..900&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background-color: #fff;
        font-family: "Outfit", sans-serif;
      }

      .content-wrapper {
        border: 1px solid #d3d3d3;
        border-radius: 12px;
        width: 95%;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 30px auto;
        padding: 20px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      .header-wrapper {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
      }

      .header-box {
        background: #97c15c;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        text-align: center;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 560px;
      }

      .header-box h1 {
        font-size: 48px;
        margin: 0;
        color: #fff;
      }

      .main-box {
        border: 2px solid black;
        border-radius: 10px;
        width: 90%;
        max-width: 450px;
        margin: 20px auto;
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .main-box p {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #333;
      }

      .credentials-box {
        background-color: #eeeeee;
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        margin: 15px 0;
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      .credentials-box span {
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        color: #666;
        font-size: 12px;
        margin-top: 20px;
        padding-bottom: 10px;
      }

      .note {
        color: #555;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="content-wrapper">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="header-wrapper">
        <div class="header-box">
          <h1>{{appName}}</h1>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Content -->
      <div class="main-box">
        <p>Hello {{fullName}},</p>
        <p>
          We are excited to have you on board as a member at Aleh. Below are
          your system credentials that you will use to track your leave and work
          from home requests. You can also download your salary slips from the
          app:
        </p>

        <div class="credentials-box">
          <p><span>Email:</span> {{email}}</p>
          <p><span>Password:</span> {{password}}</p>
        </div>

        <p class="note">
          If you have any question, feel free to reach out to your manager.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <div class="footer">{{year}}, Aleh. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>